HOMER is an advanced home management application for Unix users.

- provide a home management background service
  - launched on login
  - runs under systemd
  - maintains user configs, repos, services, applications
  - provides many other lispy endpoints

- provide the UI trifecta - GUI, Web, and CLI
  - interactive debugging and exploration with McCLIM
  - live monitoring and mobile access over web client
  - drive manual via CLI